{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b142d9f7d3ac5438","name":"Guardian Spirit Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-b142d9f7d3ac5438","title":"Guardian Spirit Talent Tree","revision":20429,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:49:53Z","sha256":"55aa85475d9e7cf202a4ea6e3614bf3010adca7a99686c8fe6b4d7166090633d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20429","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Guardian%20Spirit%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b142d9f7d3ac5438","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have a spirit watching over you, providing advice and continuing your training in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Although ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Spirits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Spirits"}," cannot physically aid you, their guidance is critical to your success.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Crucial Advice"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you fail a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", you can reroll the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," with a +2 circumstance bonus. (In the case of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," with multiple possible results, such as when activating a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with multiple effects, failing a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," is defined as achieving less than the minimum DC for that check.)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Distracting Apparition"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Manifest Guardian Spirit"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you have a manifested Guardian Spirit, the Guardian Spirit also discourages your enemies and distracts them from their goals. Any enemy within 3 squares of your Guardian Spirit takes a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," and a -2 penalty on attack rolls against you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Guardian Spirit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You have a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Guardian Spirit"]}," watching over you from the realm of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", providing you with insight and advice. Your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Guardian Spirit"]}," might be an old mentor or an ancient member of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Tradition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Tradition"}," who has chosen to guide your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search Your Feelings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill, you can instead choose to consult your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Guardian Spirit"]},". When you do so, you learn more than just whether the results of your actions will be favorable or unfavorable; you also learn the nature of any immediate consequences, including potential encounters, and whether or not certain actions will bring you closer to achieving your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"},". Additionally, you gain one bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," each day (available after you rest for at least 6 hours). This bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," can only be used to improve a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," or activate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Technique"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Technique"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Secret"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Secret"},". If you do not spend your bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," in a given day, it is lost at the start of the next day. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Manifest Guardian Spirit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to have your Guardian Spirit manifest for the duration of the encounter. Your Guardian Spirit appears in any square within 6 squares of you. A Guardian Spirit occupies a space, but creatures can move through the Guardian Spirit without obstruction. As long as the Guardian Spirit remains within 12 squares of you, you gain a +1 morale bonus on attack rolls, a +2 morale bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks, and a +2 morale bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". You can move the Guardian Spirit up to 6 squares as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," once per turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vital Encouragement"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, your Guardian Spirit offers you ",{"tag":"b","children":["Vital Encouragement"]},", urging you to press on despite adversity. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to 10 + one-half your Heroic Level. Damage is subtracted from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," first, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," remaining at the end of the encounter are lost. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," from multiple sources do not stack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
